{"v":"2026-08-27","f":[{"i":"AINIU8","n":"Niue Moana Mahu Marine Protected Area","c":"Niue","d":"Marine Protected Area","k":1,"l":4,"rf":2,"hl":2,"tr":2,"sp":3,"an":1,"en":2,"dv":2,"pu":"To provide for the protection of the natural integrity and values of the Niue Moana Mahu Marine Protected Area, generally free from extractive activities, but supporting other reasonable ecologically sustainable use.","re":"The following activities are prohibited: 1. Drift-netting. 2. Use of explosives, firearms, poison or chemicals for fishing. 3. Extractive scientific research by all methods. 4. Deployment of anchored fish aggregation devices. 5. Deployment of drifting fish aggregation devices. 6. Gillnetting. 7. Horizontal multiple hook pelagic and demersal long linning and vertical long linning. 8. All other hook and line fishing.…","rn":"Niue Moana Mahu Marine Protected Area Regulations 2020","rs":"","ma":"Cabinet of Ministers of Niue","se":"Year-round","u":null,"pm":100,"b":[-22.42417,-170.24715,-18.23945,-166.3002],"g":[[[[-18.23945,-166.53511],[-18.55255,-169.80757],[-18.55546,-169.78162],[-18.55932,-169.75827],[-18.56811,-169.71686],[-18.57151,-169.70321],[-18.57583,-169.68809],[-18.5801,-169.67488],[-18.58445,-169.66271],[-18.59603,-169.63427],[-18.60227,-169.6207],[-18.60771,-169.6098],[-18.62022,-169.58726],[-18.62737,-169.57568],[-18.63487,-169.56435],[-18.64273,-169.55329],[-18.65082,-169.54263],[-18.66234,-169.52829],[-18.67097,-169.51816],[-18.6811,-169.50706],[-18.69035,-169.4976],[-18.69989,-169.48845],[-18.70958,-169.47973],[-18.72,-169.47095],[-18.73052,-169.46267],[-18.7413,-169.45476],[-18.75231,-169.44722],[-18.76391,-169.43984],[-18.7766,-169.43229],[-18.79211,-169.4237],[-18.80636,-169.41659],[-18.82005,-169.41041],[-18.83622,-169.4039],[-18.85138,-169.39855],[-18.86821,-169.39342],[-18.88525,-169.38906],[-18.90014,-169.38591],[-18.92192,-169.37683],[-18.94485,-169.36887],[-18.96602,-169.3629],[-18.9893,-169.35781],[-19.01112,-169.35439],[-19.03399,-169.3521